## Known Limitations

- Host Node is `v25.9.0`; project requires Node `>=22.13.0 <23.0.0`. The warning is recorded and not hidden by changing project constraints.
- Mission Control build emits third-party `use client` module directive warnings from React Query and lucide packages; build still exits 0.
- C20 does not execute an auxiliary model/provider Judge; it stores and validates Judge decision facts for later provider-backed stages.
- C20 does not connect NotebookLM, browser/computer use, voice, business SaaS, MCP, Telegram, Discord, Slack, WhatsApp, Signal, Web, or external API providers.
